{
  "_README": [
    "Regole Firebase Realtime Database — Resi Telos + Portale Tracking Resi.",
    "",
    "RETROCOMPATIBILITA': tutti i nodi usati dal gestionale (returns, chat, presence,",
    "admin, security_log, notifEvents, notif, ocrLive, mailFollowups, pkgphotos,",
    "_backups, codeMem, _killswitch) mantengono ESATTAMENTE le regole della v1.",
    "Il gestionale continua a funzionare con auth anonima senza alcuna modifica.",
    "",
    "NOVITA' PORTALE: i nodi portal_* usano autenticazione REALE (email/password)",
    "con Custom Claims. Il claim 'prole' (portal role) e' impostato dalla Netlify",
    "Function portal-claims.js tramite Firebase Admin SDK.",
    "",
    "MODELLO DI ACCESSO PORTALE",
    "  I ruoli interni (ADMIN, TELOS) leggono returns/ direttamente.",
    "  I ruoli esterni (CLIENTE, AGENTE, CORRIERE) NON leggono mai returns/:",
    "  leggono solo la proiezione portal_view/<scope>/<scopeId>/ che contiene un",
    "  sottoinsieme di campi. Le regole autorizzano lo scopeId confrontandolo con",
    "  la lista in portal_users/<uid>/scope/<scopeId> === true.",
    "  Questo evita di dover iterare array dentro i claim (impossibile in RTDB).",
    "",
    "NOTA SU portal_counters: e' l'unico nodo del portale leggibile anche",
    "dall'auth ANONIMA del gestionale, che deve poter mostrare il badge con il",
    "numero di cose in arrivo dall'esterno. Contiene solo numeri aggregati",
    "(quante richieste pendenti, quanti contestati, quanti messaggi): nessun",
    "nome, nessun codice, nessun dato di un cliente specifico. La scrittura",
    "resta riservata allo staff.",
    "",
    "APPLICARE: Firebase Console -> Realtime Database -> Regole -> incolla -> Pubblica."
  ],

  "rules": {
    ".read": false,
    ".write": false,

    "returns": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      "$key": {
        ".write": "auth != null",
        ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['cod']) || !newData.exists()",
        "cod":  { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 200" },
        "note": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 5000" },
        "$other": { ".validate": true }
      }
    },

    "chat": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      "$msgId": {
        ".write": "auth != null && (!data.exists() || data.child('who').val() == newData.child('who').val())",
        ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['who','ts'])",
        "who":   { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 80" },
        "role":  { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 20" },
        "text":  { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 4000" },
        "photo": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && (newData.val().matches(/^data:image\\//) || newData.val().matches(/^https:\\/\\//)) && newData.val().length < 400000" },
        "file":  { ".validate": "newData.isString() && (newData.val().matches(/^data:/) || newData.val().matches(/^https:\\/\\//)) && newData.val().length < 400000" },
        "fileName": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 200" },
        "ts":    { ".validate": "newData.isNumber()" },
        "$other": { ".validate": true }
      }
    },

    "presence": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      "$user": {
        ".write": "auth != null"
      }
    },

    "admin": {
      "pinHash": {
        ".read": "auth != null",
        ".write": "auth != null",
        ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length > 10 && newData.val().length < 400"
      },
      "$sec": {
        ".read": "auth != null",
        ".write": "auth != null"
      }
    },

    "security_log": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      "$k": {
        ".write": "auth != null && !data.exists()",
        ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['ts','who'])",
        "ts":  { ".validate": "newData.isNumber()" },
        "who": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 80" },
        "$other": { ".validate": true }
      }
    },

    "notifEvents": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      "$k": { ".write": "auth != null" }
    },

    "notif": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      "$k": { ".write": "auth != null" }
    },

    "ocrLive": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      "$k": { ".write": "auth != null" }
    },

    "mailFollowups": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      "$k": { ".write": "auth != null" }
    },

    "pkgphotos": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      "$k": {
        ".write": "auth != null",
        ".validate": "!newData.exists() || newData.child('dataUrl').val().length < 4000000"
      }
    },

    "_backups": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      "$k": { ".write": "auth != null" }
    },

    "codeMem": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      "$cod": {
        ".write": "auth != null",
        ".validate": "!newData.exists() || (newData.hasChild('pre') && newData.child('pre').isString() && newData.child('pre').val().length < 10)"
      }
    },

    "_killswitch": {
      ".read": true,
      ".write": "auth != null"
    },

    "portal_users": {
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS')",
      "$uid": {
        ".read": "auth != null && (auth.uid == $uid || auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS')",
        ".write": "auth != null && auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN'",
        ".validate": "!newData.exists() || newData.hasChildren(['email','role'])",
        "email":       { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 200" },
        "role":        { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().matches(/^(ADMIN|TELOS|CLIENTE|AGENTE|CORRIERE)$/)" },
        "displayName": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 120" },
        "company":     { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 200" },
        "phone":       { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 40" },
        "active":      { ".validate": "newData.isBoolean()" },
        "createdAt":   { ".validate": "newData.isNumber()" },
        "scope": {
          "$scopeId": { ".validate": "newData.isBoolean()" }
        },
        "prefs": {
          ".write": "auth != null && auth.uid == $uid",
          "$p": { ".validate": "newData.isString() || newData.isBoolean() || newData.isNumber()" }
        },
        "fcmTokens": {
          ".write": "auth != null && auth.uid == $uid",
          "$token": { ".validate": "newData.isNumber()" }
        },
        "lastLogin": {
          ".write": "auth != null && auth.uid == $uid",
          ".validate": "newData.isNumber()"
        },
        "$other": { ".validate": true }
      }
    },

    "portal_view": {
      "client": {
        "$scopeId": {
          ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS' || (auth.token.prole == 'CLIENTE' && root.child('portal_users').child(auth.uid).child('scope').child($scopeId).val() == true))",
          ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS')"
        }
      },
      "agent": {
        "$scopeId": {
          ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS' || (auth.token.prole == 'AGENTE' && root.child('portal_users').child(auth.uid).child('scope').child($scopeId).val() == true))",
          ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS')"
        }
      },
      "courier": {
        "$scopeId": {
          ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS' || (auth.token.prole == 'CORRIERE' && root.child('portal_users').child(auth.uid).child('scope').child($scopeId).val() == true))",
          ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS')"
        }
      }
    },

    "portal_access": {
      "$uid": {
        ".read": "auth != null && (auth.uid == $uid || auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS')",
        ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS')",
        "$returnKey": { ".validate": "newData.isBoolean()" }
      }
    },

    "portal_timeline": {
      "$returnKey": {
        ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS' || root.child('portal_access').child(auth.uid).child($returnKey).val() == true)",
        "$eventId": {
          ".write": "auth != null && !data.exists() && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS' || root.child('portal_access').child(auth.uid).child($returnKey).val() == true)",
          ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['ts','actor','actorRole','action'])",
          "ts":        { ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() <= now + 60000" },
          "actor":     { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 200 && newData.val() == auth.uid" },
          "actorName": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 120" },
          "actorRole": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val() == auth.token.prole" },
          "action":    { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 40" },
          "from":      { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 60" },
          "to":        { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 60" },
          "note":      { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 2000" },
          "attachments": {
            "$i": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 600" }
          },
          "$other": { ".validate": false }
        }
      }
    },

    "portal_messages": {
      "$returnKey": {
        ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS' || root.child('portal_access').child(auth.uid).child($returnKey).val() == true)",
        "$msgId": {
          ".write": "auth != null && !data.exists() && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS' || root.child('portal_access').child(auth.uid).child($returnKey).val() == true)",
          ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['ts','from','fromRole','text'])",
          "ts":       { ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() <= now + 60000" },
          "from":     { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val() == auth.uid" },
          "fromName": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 120" },
          "fromRole": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val() == auth.token.prole" },
          "text":     { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length > 0 && newData.val().length < 4000" },
          "attachments": {
            "$i": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 600" }
          },
          "$other": { ".validate": false }
        }
      }
    },

    "portal_documents": {
      "$returnKey": {
        ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS' || root.child('portal_access').child(auth.uid).child($returnKey).val() == true)",
        "$docId": {
          ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS' || root.child('portal_access').child(auth.uid).child($returnKey).val() == true) && (!data.exists() || auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || data.child('uploadedBy').val() == auth.uid)",
          ".validate": "!newData.exists() || newData.hasChildren(['ts','uploadedBy','filename','storagePath'])",
          "ts":          { ".validate": "newData.isNumber()" },
          "uploadedBy":  { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val() == auth.uid" },
          "uploaderName":{ ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 120" },
          "uploaderRole":{ ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val() == auth.token.prole" },
          "type":        { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 40" },
          "filename":    { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 260" },
          "storagePath": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 600" },
          "size":        { ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() <= 15728640" },
          "contentType": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 120" },
          "$other": { ".validate": false }
        }
      }
    },

    "portal_requests": {
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS')",
      "$reqId": {
        ".read": "auth != null && data.child('createdBy').val() == auth.uid",
        ".write": "auth != null && ((!data.exists() && newData.child('createdBy').val() == auth.uid) || auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS')",
        ".validate": "!newData.exists() || newData.hasChildren(['ts','createdBy','state'])",
        "ts":         { ".validate": "newData.isNumber()" },
        "createdBy":  { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 200" },
        "createdName":{ ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 120" },
        "createdRole":{ ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 20" },
        "state":      { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 40" },
        "clientCode": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 40" },
        "note":       { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 2000" },
        "$other": { ".validate": true }
      }
    },

    "portal_config": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      "sla": {
        ".write": "auth != null && auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN'",
        "$state": {
          "warnHours": { ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() >= 0" },
          "critHours": { ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() >= 0" },
          "$other": { ".validate": false }
        }
      },
      "brand": {
        ".write": "auth != null && auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN'",
        "$k": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 4000" }
      },
      "flags": {
        ".write": "auth != null && auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN'",
        "$k": { ".validate": "newData.isBoolean() || newData.isString() || newData.isNumber()" }
      }
    },

    "portal_notifications": {
      "$uid": {
        ".read": "auth != null && auth.uid == $uid",
        ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS' || auth.uid == $uid)",
        "$nid": {
          ".validate": "!newData.exists() || newData.hasChildren(['ts','title'])",
          "ts":        { ".validate": "newData.isNumber()" },
          "title":     { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 200" },
          "body":      { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 1000" },
          "returnKey": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 200" },
          "read":      { ".validate": "newData.isBoolean()" },
          "$other": { ".validate": false }
        }
      }
    },

    "portal_audit": {
      ".read": "auth != null && auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN'",
      "$k": {
        ".write": "auth != null && !data.exists()",
        ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['ts','uid','action'])",
        "ts":     { ".validate": "newData.isNumber()" },
        "uid":    { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val() == auth.uid" },
        "role":   { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 20" },
        "action": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 80" },
        "target": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 300" },
        "detail": { ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length < 2000" },
        "$other": { ".validate": false }
      }
    },

    "portal_sync_meta": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS')"
    },

    "portal_counters": {
      ".read": "auth != null",
      ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.prole == 'ADMIN' || auth.token.prole == 'TELOS')",
      "staff": {
        ".validate": "newData.hasChildren(['total'])",
        "pending":   { ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() >= 0" },
        "contested": { ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() >= 0" },
        "messages":  { ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() >= 0" },
        "total":     { ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() >= 0" },
        "ts":        { ".validate": "newData.isNumber()" },
        "$other": { ".validate": false }
      }
    }
  }
}
